# Node package manager lock files (optional - uncomment if you want strict versions)
# frontend/package-lock.json
# frontend/yarn.lock

# ── Client-supplied source documents — never commit ──────────────────
# Company profiles, briefs, proposals, contracts and scans. These carry
# client material that must not be distributed with the code, so they are
# ignored everywhere in the tree with no exceptions.
#
# What the documents contribute (copy, brand colours, service lines) belongs
# in code instead — e.g. frontend/app/components/hygiene/brand.ts, which is
# where the Dyzah Hygiene profile was transcribed. See docs/DYZAH_HYGIENE.md.
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.doc
*.docx
*.odt
*.rtf
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.ods
*.ppt
*.pptx
